    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[晚归]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Later back</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Later back"/>
        <updated>2025-11-29T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>暮日悬徊  游影忘归</p>
<p>她轻轻掸平衣角</p>
<p>抖落一地余晖</p>
<hr>
<p>流云沦醉  林涛荡辉</p>
<p>远山朦影</p>
<p>烟晓何处啼惊帷</p>
<hr>
<p>风聆吟敲推</p>
<p>捎带着玄叶  跟随</p>
<p>青帘掩映着</p>
<p>透过依稀  重影微</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Later back" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Later back</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
