    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[失眠]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Bad sleep</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Bad sleep"/>
        <updated>2025-10-19T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>灯忽骤着在变换</p>
<p>时间也在其间横穿</p>
<p>月亮的影子游曳在墙上</p>
<p>星星也就着浮云作伴</p>
<hr>
<p>半个爬上窗台的月光</p>
<p>好奇地摆弄着桌上的玻璃盏</p>
<p>树梢间也摇来晓风弯弯</p>
<p>猫儿伸了伸身子</p>
<p>眼睛绕着月亮</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Bad sleep" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Bad sleep</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
