    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[窗棂]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The window</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The window"/>
        <updated>2025-09-13T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>暮光游过我的窗棂</p>
<p>悄然带来深空的回音</p>
<p>是夜无声寂静</p>
<p>只有风还在我的耳边轻声低鸣</p>
<p>那游离零乱的星星</p>
<p>是否已带走了你的只单形影</p>
<p>是否我们已在共赏今夜月明</p>
<p>云拂月畔  你是否也在等待我的聆听？</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The window" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The window</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
