    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[海岸]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/For mother</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/For mother"/>
        <updated>2025-05-11T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>扬起一片孤帆</p>
<p>让未来与波涛轮转</p>
<p>海风微微流散</p>
<p>海面与澄蓝</p>
<p>也轻轻一起把手挽</p>
<hr>
<p>孤帆行船日月流转</p>
<p>多么空阔这星汉灿烂</p>
<p>多么清爽这海风舒软</p>
<p>船已不知何时离岸</p>
<p>心却扯着海岸线</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/For mother" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/For mother</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
