    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[烟火上的时光]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Time above the firework</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Time above the firework"/>
        <updated>2025-05-06T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>小窗  灯黄</p>
<p>一抹新月抚过山岗</p>
<p>静树无言  云疏晚妆</p>
<p>纤纤风中流云飘荡</p>
<hr>
<p>天野苍苍  风径茫茫</p>
<p>璨然烟火</p>
<p>也燃不尽寥寥两行</p>
<p>漫天倾乱如霜降</p>
<p>眼见的却只</p>
<p>散落一地余光</p>
<p>--</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Time above the firework" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Time above the firework</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
