    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[云舟]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Cloud boat by the  time</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Cloud boat by the  time"/>
        <updated>2025-04-28T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>悠悠云啾啾</p>
<p>水波空望丘</p>
<p>淡卷风追云吹去</p>
<p>翠坠光垂水轻酬</p>
<hr>
<p>依依  是薄云依旧</p>
<p>青青  是翠衫满楼</p>
<p>晓风呼骤</p>
<p>云掩帘头</p>
<hr>
<p>悠扬的云廊之上</p>
<p>几里点淡蓝的洋流</p>
<p>随时光游</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Cloud boat by the  time" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Cloud boat by the  time</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
