    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[错过]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Passed by</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Passed by"/>
        <updated>2025-04-17T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>逝去的总是很多很多</p>
<p>瀚瀚如车流穿过</p>
<p>留下杳杳无若</p>
<p>微忆星火</p>
<hr>
<p>时弦轻着</p>
<p>微叹境迁时过</p>
<p>隐隐不见余光吹落</p>
<p>无心地扔掉很多很多</p>
<hr>
<p>走在漫漫长路上</p>
<p>所见皆往匆匆流过</p>
<p>无</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Passed by" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Passed by</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
