    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[之中]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Within</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Within"/>
        <updated>2025-04-17T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>青青山色雾轻拢</p>
<p>悠悠彩云影相重</p>
<hr>
<p>好渴望这样的世界啊</p>
<p>没有忙忙匆匆</p>
<p>心事重重</p>
<p>旧事种种</p>
<hr>
<p>往事都像游絮一样</p>
<p>离散在空中</p>
<p>微风的指尖</p>
<p>稍带点初春的懵懂</p>
<hr>
<p>飞</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Within" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Within</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
