    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[春朝织]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The weaving of spring scenery</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The weaving of spring scenery"/>
        <updated>2025-04-03T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>淡彩苍织</p>
<p>霓虹空蚀</p>
<p>一丛一丛的错枝</p>
<p>一叶一叶的舟矢</p>
<p>都在相互望着无时</p>
<hr>
<p>地上—</p>
<p>风弦无心拨栀</p>
<p>彩绸挂满虬枝</p>
<p>淡且盛且鲜妍</p>
<p>浓且羞且微显</p>
<p>馨香散湿</p>
<p>流风遍执</p>
<hr>
<p>天</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The weaving of spring scenery" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The weaving of spring scenery</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
