    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[匆匆]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Rush time</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Rush time"/>
        <updated>2025-03-16T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>风儿轻轻摇曳</p>
<p>惊蝉落叶流泻</p>
<p>携来远方  携来花叶</p>
<p>带着远方的思绪</p>
<p>在这里书写</p>
<hr>
<p>晓看浮云飘别</p>
<p>送走雨丝棉叶</p>
<p>灯也倾斜  雨也微斜</p>
<p>只在此</p>
<p>匆匆留下</p>
<p>未写完的诗篇</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Rush time" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Rush time</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
