    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[飞沙]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The sand by the sea of time</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The sand by the sea of time"/>
        <updated>2025-03-02T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>晓风  流荧  云纱</p>
<p>幽芳  青竹  飞花</p>
<p>眼望这满世界的过客啊</p>
<p>无人停下</p>
<hr>
<p>春发  蝉夏</p>
<p>秋月  冬花</p>
<p>记住了什么</p>
<p>却总也不知该如何回答</p>
<hr>
<p>星海漫卷</p>
<p>日月更行</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The sand by the sea of time" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The sand by the sea of time</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
