    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[风]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Wind</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Wind"/>
        <updated>2025-02-10T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>你像波浪一样</p>
<p>轻轻飘来</p>
<p>挑逗枝丫间的绿漾</p>
<p>悄悄摘下几片花瓣</p>
<p>在平广的旷野上</p>
<p>带走三分</p>
<p>淡淡的清香</p>
<hr>
<p>越过浓郁的青山</p>
<p>是雪白的故乡</p>
<p>偶尔从不知名的远方</p>
<p>传来你的回响</p>
<p>我的</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Wind" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Wind</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
