    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[春]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Spring</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Spring"/>
        <updated>2025-01-18T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>纤小的枝条</p>
<p>被风轻轻抚起</p>
<p>空中游离的白絮</p>
<p>对上一场清雪</p>
<p>也似乎仍未忘记</p>
<p>青鸟衔来几枝嫩叶</p>
<p>碧蓝的静谧</p>
<p>对着纷杂的低空涮洗</p>
<p>偶尔空中捎来</p>
<p>几瓣轻轻的彩衣</p>
<p>在里面承载着</p>
<p>对一整个春天</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Spring" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Spring</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
