    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[星钟]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Starlight flowing pointer</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Starlight flowing pointer"/>
        <updated>2024-12-27T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>以深遂为背景</p>
<p>以繁星为指针</p>
<p>以寰字为中心</p>
<p>以流年为齿轮</p>
<hr>
<p>有繁硕的倾盆</p>
<p>也有燃烬</p>
<p>所滑过的余温</p>
<hr>
<p>是月明时的陌生人</p>
<p>也是昏暝时的引路人</p>
<p>是随处隐逸的无声</p>
<p>却也是</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Starlight flowing pointer" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Starlight flowing pointer</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
