    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[秋风与星星]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Foiling and wishing</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Foiling and wishing"/>
        <updated>2024-12-12T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>星光在昼夜中更替</p>
<p>霓霞在交光中掀起</p>
<p>我们却</p>
<p>总是在落叶后追忆</p>
<p>面对着黄花满地</p>
<p>不住地叹息</p>
<hr>
<p>叹息又有什么用呢？</p>
<p>或许</p>
<p>他都不能保留</p>
<p>你来过的痕迹</p>
<p>却会在你心中</p>
<p>留下重重</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Foiling and wishing" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Foiling and wishing</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
