    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[记]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Remembering</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Remembering"/>
        <updated>2024-11-11T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>不知从何时起</p>
<p>记忆便在脑海中</p>
<p>不断清洗</p>
<p>洗去了一天又一天</p>
<p>一季  又一季</p>
<p>究竟洗去了什么</p>
<p>也不知从何问起</p>
<hr>
<p>定义的清晰</p>
<p>也只是暂存的余迹</p>
<p>残存的心系</p>
<p>也不过未经的此彼</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Remembering" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Remembering</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
