    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[云睹]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Alone the clouds</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Alone the clouds"/>
        <updated>2024-10-19T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>夜  落幕</p>
<p>云  迁逐</p>
<hr>
<p>一片若有若无的</p>
<p>色晕</p>
<p>伴着流云</p>
<p>寻逐</p>
<hr>
<p>薄薄云雾</p>
<p>流露  不复</p>
<p>漫漫时途</p>
<p>不住  踌躇</p>
<hr>
<p>或许</p>
<p>碰上个云团</p>
<p>也是个未知数</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Alone the clouds" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Alone the clouds</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
