    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[云]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lovely clouds</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lovely clouds"/>
        <updated>2024-10-12T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>淡淡的颜色</p>
<p>悠悠地流着</p>
<p>天河</p>
<hr>
<p>千变的莫测</p>
<p>慢慢地变着</p>
<p>风车</p>
<p>微微轻风</p>
<p>朗朗晴空</p>
<p>都在飘泊着</p>
<p>过客</p>
<hr>
<p>绿叶摇曳着</p>
<p>落下</p>
<p>粉荷</p>
<p>在风中飞舞着</p>
<hr>
<p>只是在</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lovely clouds" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lovely clouds</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
