    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[小村]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Leisurely village</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Leisurely village"/>
        <updated>2024-09-19T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>小小的山村</p>
<p>坐在重叠的山郭</p>
<p>清清的流水</p>
<p>躺在错杂的村落</p>
<p>疲阳沉落</p>
<hr>
<p>淡淡的云朵</p>
<p>飘过几家淡淡的烟火</p>
<p>淡淡的归途</p>
<p>传过几声淡淡的牛哞</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Leisurely village" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Leisurely village</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
