    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[故乡]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Home town</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Home town"/>
        <updated>2024-09-03T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>故乡  在哪里</p>
<p>故乡有碧绿的长廊</p>
<p>翠竹挺挺</p>
<p>古松苍苍</p>
<hr>
<p>故乡会清脆地歌唱</p>
<p>泉声潺潺</p>
<p>暮鼓悠长</p>
<hr>
<p>故乡是一颗种子</p>
<p>故乡有泥土的芬芳</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Home town" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Home town</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
