    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[停留的地方]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Places of love staying</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Places of love staying"/>
        <updated>2024-08-21T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>树叶沙沙响</p>
<p>那是风走过的地方</p>
<p>蝴蝶翩翩翔</p>
<p>那是花开遍的地方</p>
<hr>
<p>世界很大很大</p>
<p>大到看不到头</p>
<p>山高水长</p>
<p>世界很小很小</p>
<p>小到不过几人</p>
<p>便无物可装</p>
<hr>
<p>炊烟静静长</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Places of love staying" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Places of love staying</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
