    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[避风港的灯火]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Mother`s love always</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Mother`s love always"/>
        <updated>2024-08-14T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>家是温暖的避风港</p>
<p>里面的灯火</p>
<p>从不打烊</p>
<hr>
<p>在里面的</p>
<p>有亲爱的母亲啊</p>
<p>母亲的心</p>
<p>像天一样宽广</p>
<p>广到</p>
<p>我们飞也飞不出</p>
<p>看也看不到尽头</p>
<p>母亲的事</p>
<p>像针线一样细长</p>
<p>长到</p>
<p>像</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Mother`s love always" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Mother`s love always</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
