    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[不再]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Not that time</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Not that time"/>
        <updated>2024-06-23T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>当我们不再  热爱</p>
<p>生活</p>
<p>便显得无力苍白</p>
<p>风景也不再精彩</p>
<hr>
<p>当我们不再  释怀</p>
<p>就不会想起</p>
<p>往事不再</p>
<p>过去</p>
<p>已无法更改</p>
<hr>
<p>当你不在</p>
<p>我便不知</p>
<p>这里是该来</p>
<p>还是</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Not that time" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Not that time</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
