    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[小径和蒲公英]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Memories and thought</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Memories and thought"/>
        <updated>2024-06-07T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>天边浮云轻轻</p>
<p>小径气息清新</p>
<p>沉睡的小径</p>
<p>又开遍了蒲公英</p>
<hr>
<p>你说过</p>
<p>当这条小径</p>
<p>开满蒲公英</p>
<p>除了风景</p>
<p>还会有你</p>
<hr>
<p>路好静好静</p>
<p>静静带走了心灵</p>
<p>风好轻好轻</p>
<p>轻轻托</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Memories and thought" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Memories and thought</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
