    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[云彩流逝]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Fading clouds</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Fading clouds"/>
        <updated>2024-05-29T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>校园的花</p>
<p>又亭亭挂上了树枝</p>
<p>转眼间</p>
<p>三年也将流逝</p>
<p>手握的一支一支</p>
<p>笔下的一纸一纸</p>
<p>也试图</p>
<p>将流逝延迟</p>
<hr>
<p>可我只见</p>
<p>记忆被时间打碎</p>
<p>被流水侵蚀</p>
<p>只剩碎片为止</p>
<p>我想奋力捡</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Fading clouds" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Fading clouds</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
