    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[等]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/waiting</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/waiting"/>
        <updated>2024-05-19T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>微雨轻轻</p>
<p>窗外白羽稀稀</p>
<p>路旁的树儿</p>
<p>轻轻接住了这希望</p>
<p>一滴又一滴</p>
<hr>
<p>薄云依依</p>
<p>天上白纸清清</p>
<p>窗内的蒲公英</p>
<p>等待着这风儿</p>
<p>一季  又一季</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/waiting" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/waiting</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
