    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[回忆]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Memory</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Memory"/>
        <updated>2024-05-06T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>回忆像风</p>
<p>吹过来</p>
<p>吹过去</p>
<p>吹动了我的心绪</p>
<p>却吹不动我</p>
<p>回忆像水</p>
<p>流过来</p>
<p>流过去</p>
<p>流在我的心间</p>
<p>我却抓也抓不住</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Memory" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Memory</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
