    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[星星]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/star</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/star"/>
        <updated>2024-04-17T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>把星星挂在天上</p>
<p>让迷路的人</p>
<p>能够找回方向</p>
<p>把星星贴在墙上</p>
<p>让可爱的孩子</p>
<p>安然进入梦乡</p>
<p>把星星放在心上</p>
<p>让远行的游子</p>
<p>总是心存希望</p>
<p>你像星星一样</p>
<p>散发着星光</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/star" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/star</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
