    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[远方]]></title>
        <id>https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Distance</id>
        <link href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Distance"/>
        <updated>2024-04-03T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>在一片微朦中</p>
<p>向东</p>
<p>水光潋滟</p>
<p>往事随风</p>
<p>在一阵清爽里</p>
<p>回忆</p>
<p>轻言静谧</p>
<p>虹光四溢</p>
<p>在清晨看雨</p>
<p>在夏夜看星</p>
<p>我在远方</p>
<p>等待着 曾经的你</p>
<br/><p>访问 <a href="https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Distance" target="_blank">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Distance</a> 阅读全文。</p>]]></content>
